  - id: C:event/foundation-capital-2023
    type: event
    name: Foundation capital contribution to the fund, 2023
    summary: The 2023 Form 990 Schedule R Part V records a cash gift, grant or capital contribution of $24,963,716 to Mozilla Ventures I, LP, and a $165,851 service agreement.
